{
  "id": "25408_sankasuru",
  "headword": "{参加|さんか}する",
  "reading": "さんかする",
  "romaji": "sankasuru",
  "part_of_speech": "suru verb",
  "gloss": "to participate; to take part in",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to participate; to take part in; to join",
      "explanation": "To become involved in an activity, event, or group by actively taking part."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "25408_sankasuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{会議|かいぎ}に{参加|さんか}する。",
      "english": "I participate in the meeting.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "25408_sankasuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{今年|ことし}のマラソン{大会|たいかい}に{参加|さんか}しました。",
      "english": "I participated in this year's marathon event.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "25408_sankasuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{誰|だれ}でも{自由|じゆう}にこのプロジェクトに{参加|さんか}することができます。",
      "english": "Anyone can freely participate in this project.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "{参加|さんか}する means to join in or take part in an activity, event, organization, or discussion. It emphasizes the act of becoming involved rather than merely being present.\n\nUSAGE:\nThe event or activity is marked with the particle に: ～に{参加|さんか}する.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {会議|かいぎ}に{参加|さんか}する: participate in a meeting\n- イベントに{参加|さんか}する: take part in an event\n- {試合|しあい}に{参加|さんか}する: compete in a match\n- ボランティアに{参加|さんか}する: volunteer; take part in volunteering\n- {議論|ぎろん}に{参加|さんか}する: join a discussion\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {出席|しゅっせき}する: to attend — focuses on being present rather than active involvement\n- {加入|かにゅう}する: to join (an organization) — emphasizes formal membership rather than activity participation\n- {加|くわ}わる: to join in — more casual, often used when joining something already in progress",
  "schema_version": "2.0",
